OL,3,GNEWSANew NHS cancer drug is
OL,4,A'bittersweet' for widower
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who lost his wife to breast
OL,7,Fcancer has described the drug which
OL,8,Fcould have extended her life finally
OL,9,Fbeing made available on the NHS in
OL,10,FEngland as "bittersweet".
OL,12,FFionnuala Quinlan-Bennett, a primary
OL,13,Fschool teacher from Crawley, West
OL,14,FSussex, died in June aged 32 after
OL,15,Fbeing told the disease had spread to
OL,16,Fher bones and liver.
OL,18,FUntil this week, Enhertu - a treatment
OL,19,Fsaid to give patients additional months
OL,20,For even years - had been deemed too
OL,21,Fexpensive by the National Institute for
OL,22,FHealth and Care Excellence (NICE).
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
