OL,3,GNEWSANew NHS cancer drug is
OL,4,A'bittersweet' for widower
OL,5,
OL,6,FFionnuala's husband, Nathan Bennett,
OL,7,Fsaid he was "extremely happy for all
OL,8,Fother women who'll be able to use it
OL,9,Fmoving forward".
